 "how_to_apply": [
  "Laboratory value in the Wuhan unit divided by reference_limits[test].bands[age band].limit (lower limit for lymphocyte percentage, platelets, hemoglobin, albumin, fibrinogen and sodium; upper limit otherwise). The limits are effective Wuhan limits: the geometric mean (log-scale tests) or harmonic mean (linear-scale tests) of the limits attached to the first values of the 695 children in that age band (all ages where a band has fewer than 10 results).",
  "Reporting floors: for a test with reporting_floors[test].applied, a result reported as below a limit, or whose ratio to the reference limit is below floor_ratio, enters with ratio floor_ratio (hs-CRP only).",
  "Heart and respiratory rate: z-score for age with the Fleming centiles.",
  "Then natural log where preprocessing[indicator].log is true, clipping at winsor_low and winsor_high, and (x - mean) / sd.",
  "Posterior: diagonal Gaussian mixture with these weights, means and variances; missing indicators are left out of the likelihood (full-information likelihood). Classes are in display order S1 (hyperinflammatory) to S6 (least abnormal)."
 ],
